	(text "Pinout = panel J2 (straight T568B cable).\nPairs: 1-2 coil A, 3-6 coil B, 4-5 SDA/GND, 7-8 SCL/3V3.\nNever plug into a network device.\nNever unplug while powered (motor coils)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12 80 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "67976c29-960a-5fd0-9ab6-c463bd45a00d")
	)
	(text "R1/R2 sit in parallel with the panel 10k (R7/R8):\n3.2k in total, enough for 1 m of cable at 100 kHz.\nD2: ESD clamp on SDA/SCL where the cable enters.\nD1: lights when the cable brings 3V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a638a3f5-ad39-5c71-a434-6245a3af906d")
	)
