	(text "Pins 1-2 = coil A, pins 3-4 = coil B.\nUsual NEMA 17 cable: black, green, red, blue.\nCheck the coil pairs with an ohmmeter (about 1-3 ohm per coil).\nA wrong turning direction is fixed in firmware (DIR),\nnot by swapping wires."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 162 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
