	(text "C1 + C2 at pins 1-2: with a 3.3 V supply VDD5V and VDD3V3\nare tied together (AS5600 datasheet, 3.3 V operation).\nPGO open (internal pull-up). OUT: analog angle, test pad only.\nProbe SDA / SCL on R1 / R2.\nJP1 (DIR): GND = angle rises clockwise seen from the chip top.\nCut the bridge and bridge 2-3 to reverse it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 155 114 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2957db5b-1083-53d4-9301-1deffa322088")
	)
